{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to where true survival began.</strong><br>Set 2.4 million years ago, <i>Primal Survival</i> takes you deep into the dawn of humanity. Step into the bare footprints of <strong>Homo habilis</strong> or <strong>Homo erectus</strong>, and experience a world where survival isn't optional\u2014it's instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike modern survival games, this is not about fictional crafting with sci-fi gadgets. <i>Primal Survival</i> is about <strong>realistic, primitive survival</strong>. You must craft with stone, build shelter, hunt, and protect your tribe. But be warned\u2014you're not always the hunter. Sometimes, you're the prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 <strong>Authentic Survival Experience</strong><br>Stay alive by managing real needs: warmth, shelter, water, food, and safety. Craft primitive tools, build your hut from scratch, and learn to live off the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda3 <strong>Massive Prehistoric Beasts</strong><br>Face off against legendary animals: mammoths, smilodons (saber-toothed cats), giant birds, and elephant ancestors. Not all battles are winnable\u2014sometimes, the best survival is to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>Evolve with Your Tribe</strong><br>Start alone or form a tribe in multiplayer mode. Hunt together, build together, and grow stronger. Or fight over scarce resources in a brutal struggle for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3a <strong>Tame or Be Tamed</strong><br>Some animals want to eat you. Others might stand by your side. With time and strategy, certain species can be tamed and used in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Massive Open World</strong><br>Explore savannas, dense forests, volcanic valleys, and ancient rivers. Each biome comes with its own dangers, resources, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Deadly Nature</strong><br>Survival is more than combat. Endure storms, drought, freezing cold, heatwaves, wildfires, and more. Nature is indifferent\u2014and it will kill you if you\u2019re unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Historically Inspired</strong><br>Built on anthropological and evolutionary foundations, <i>Primal Survival</i> presents one of the most realistic prehistoric survival experiences ever created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Survival</strong> is not a fantasy\u2014it\u2019s how it might have really been.<br>Fight to live. Adapt to grow.<br><strong>Are you the hunter\u2026 or the hunted?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620610?t=1761849301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620610?t=1761849301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/13708bf3528b5a50d39e04e1519dea7eaf3dd31e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761849301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/13708bf3528b5a50d39e04e1519dea7eaf3dd31e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761849301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/36a76044d2a784e109726d63e426007c.avif?t=1761849301\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras_big/36a76044d2a784e109726d63e426007c.avif?t=1761849301 width=1560 height=1196 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.poster.avif?t=1761849301\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.webm?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/76b24430ea0305a8c3c233147887d895.mp4?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Customize Your Ancestor</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/df8a89cdd90aaa7f5432207edf85aa9f.poster.avif?t=1761849301\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/df8a89cdd90aaa7f5432207edf85aa9f.webm?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/df8a89cdd90aaa7f5432207edf85aa9f.mp4?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>The Final Show of Strength: Before the Main Course!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/c4ea48a79de45b3712b6966fc526d535.poster.avif?t=1761849301\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/c4ea48a79de45b3712b6966fc526d535.webm?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/extras/c4ea48a79de45b3712b6966fc526d535.mp4?t=1761849301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to where true survival began.</strong><br>Set 2.4 million years ago, <i>Primal Survival</i> takes you deep into the dawn of humanity. Step into the bare footprints of <strong>Homo habilis</strong> or <strong>Homo erectus</strong>, and experience a world where survival isn't optional\u2014it's instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike modern survival games, this is not about fictional crafting with sci-fi gadgets. <i>Primal Survival</i> is about <strong>realistic, primitive survival</strong>. You must craft with stone, build shelter, hunt, and protect your tribe. But be warned\u2014you're not always the hunter. Sometimes, you're the prey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea8 <strong>Authentic Survival Experience</strong><br>Stay alive by managing real needs: warmth, shelter, water, food, and safety. Craft primitive tools, build your hut from scratch, and learn to live off the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda3 <strong>Massive Prehistoric Beasts</strong><br>Face off against legendary animals: mammoths, smilodons (saber-toothed cats), giant birds, and elephant ancestors. Not all battles are winnable\u2014sometimes, the best survival is to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>Evolve with Your Tribe</strong><br>Start alone or form a tribe in multiplayer mode. Hunt together, build together, and grow stronger. Or fight over scarce resources in a brutal struggle for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3a <strong>Tame or Be Tamed</strong><br>Some animals want to eat you. Others might stand by your side. With time and strategy, certain species can be tamed and used in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Massive Open World</strong><br>Explore savannas, dense forests, volcanic valleys, and ancient rivers. Each biome comes with its own dangers, resources, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Deadly Nature</strong><br>Survival is more than combat. Endure storms, drought, freezing cold, heatwaves, wildfires, and more. Nature is indifferent\u2014and it will kill you if you\u2019re unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Historically Inspired</strong><br>Built on anthropological and evolutionary foundations, <i>Primal Survival</i> presents one of the most realistic prehistoric survival experiences ever created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Survival</strong> is not a fantasy\u2014it\u2019s how it might have really been.<br>Fight to live. Adapt to grow.<br><strong>Are you the hunter\u2026 or the hunted?</strong></p>","developers":["Quantum Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620610/bc64ac5a9efd4d8cdc79934b0d10064728819470/header.jpg?t=1761849301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761849097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761849097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3620610/1781766262/e4124406209a969e23b38c39afe564a7f0670b86/1761527668/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761849097","id":257222920,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st